[{"id":4051089958,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7xdrom","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected but there are some regressions. This is a nice usability improvement for CSG in particular.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd5c17ce-df76-4c76-8901-6b9554262f22\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- **Rotation Step** seems to have broken once you accept the Configure Snap dialog. Saving the scene and reopening the editor resets it back to 0° or 1°, as seen in the Configure Snap dialog. **Grid Step** and **Scale Step** are correctly preserved across restarts.\r\n\r\n- Accepting the Configure Snap dialog should reset the grid size multiplier/divider to the default. Right now, when you change the value and accept, the multiplier/divider is still active, which means the grid size you see (and snap to) doesn't match what you entered in the dialog.\r\n\r\nFor future PRs:\r\n\r\n- I'd like to add more shortcuts to control the grid size (so that a numpad isn't needed), but this can be done in a separate PR as to also affect the 2D editor.\r\n  - I would keep the existing numpad shortcuts in place still, so we don't break existing workflows for people used to them. That is, unless we find new use cases for these keys instead.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117935#pullrequestreview-4051089958","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117935","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117935#pullrequestreview-4051089958"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117935"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-02T14:33:19Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4053540254,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7xnB2e","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now, including across restarts 🙂 \n\nThat said, I noticed holding <kbd>Shift</kbd> will visually change the grid size, which happens even during freelook. It looks quite distracting as a result:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2284bca9-f2b1-42af-8a59-394ef9458749\n\nWhile it makes sense to change the grid's appearance when performing fine snapping, I suggest leaving it for a later PR so we can finetune it. We'll probably want to reduce the grid's opacity for non-primary squares to compensate for the increased number of lines.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117935#pullrequestreview-4053540254","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117935","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117935#pullrequestreview-4053540254"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117935"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-02T22:42:22Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4058648618,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7x6hAq","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Works great now!\n\nThis reminds me that we could add a grid size display somewhere on the viewport when snapping is enabled, but this should be discussed in its own proposal.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/g